<p><a href="https://www.cartalk.com/content/magic-hat-puzzler-0">An old puzzle</a> from the <em>Car Talk</em> radio show on NPR:</p>
<p>You and I each draw a number from a magic hat. We don&#8217;t know each other&#8217;s numbers, but the hat ensures that they&#8217;re adjacent positive integers.</p>
<p>An interlocutor now begins to ask each of us in turn whether he knows the other&#8217;s number. Eventually, one of us will answer yes. Why?</p>

